# Generated by forge from python/archive-extract (mode: forbid).
id: python/archive-extract
language: Python
severity: error
message: 'forge:python/archive-extract TarFile.extractall() / extract() and shutil.unpack_archive() pass filter= (normally "data"): without it a crafted archive writes outside the target directory (absolute paths, .., links). zipfile sanitises its paths itself.'
